# Local-only submission package (final PDF + git-archive software zip),
# assembled for uploading to the ITO submission portal -- not part of the
# repository itself.
submission/

# Superseded iterations of the visualisation prototypes: each chart's
# unsuffixed filename (e.g. radar.html) is always the current, canonical
# version described in the dissertation. Older *_v1/*_v2 HTML snapshots,
# their backup chart images, and orphaned intermediate data files (confirmed
# via grep to have zero references from the current build scripts, the test
# suite, or the dissertation) are kept local only -- only the current
# version of each directory's output stays tracked.
